// VSCO 2 CE winds and brass extras: clarinet, bassoon, trumpet and trombone,
// each with a baked zone gain that targets -24 dBFS mono body RMS.
// Upstream: sgossner/VSCO-2-CE, revision 440300901dfe9275fd84e0b7763af1f8443ae62e (CC0-1.0).
// Recordings are fetched by install.py into the gitignored assets/ directory.

// 50 unchanged CC0 recordings, verified against manifest.json by byte size and
// SHA-256. Static zone gain targets -24 dBFS mono body RMS.
// Filename octaves are one below scientific pitch. Written safe ranges:
// clarinet G3-G5 (55-79), bassoon G#1-D#4 (32-63), trumpet D#4-A5 (63-81),
// trombone B2-G4 (47-67). Originals stay unedited under the gitignored assets/.

